{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2lwfulcn","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":88,"top":226,"width":440,"height":202},"text":"MAE = (1/n) Σ |y − ŷ|\n\nRMSE = √[(1/n) Σ (y − ŷ)²]\n\nMAPE = (100/n) Σ |(y − ŷ) / y|","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#17324D","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wf6h836h","slideIndex":3,"position":{"left":88,"top":470,"width":440,"height":62},"text":"MAE gives the average absolute error in MW. RMSE gives extra weight to large misses. MAPE is reported carefully because net flow can be near zero or change sign.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":15,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#263746","alignment":"left"}}
